# Nx Angular Conventions

- Apps: `admin` (port 4200), `main` (port 4201)
- Shared libs: `@socioconnect/ui-components`, `@socioconnect/types`, `@socioconnect/utils`, `@socioconnect/constants`
- Commands: `nx serve admin`, `nx serve main`, `nx run-many -t build`, `nx run-many -t lint`, `nx run-many -t test`
- E2E: `nx e2e e2e-admin`, `nx e2e e2e-main`
- Standalone components, SCSS; selector prefix **`app`** in apps, **`sc`** in `libs/ui-components`
- **Components**: always `templateUrl` + `styleUrl` (separate `.html` / `.scss`); see `angular-agent-generation.mdc` (always applied) for modern syntax (`@if`/`@for`, `input()`/`output()`, signals, `inject()`)
- Domain layout: `shell/*.routing.ts`, `feature/`, `ui/`, `data-access/`, `utils/`, `types/` — see `ARCHITECTURE.md`
- Code and comments in English unless specified otherwise
